0Core%27s%20power."],"citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Episode 5: The Two Guardians","series":"Magic Story","authors":["A. T. Greenblatt"],"date":"2020-09-30","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-5-two-guardians-2020-09-30","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-5-two-guardians-2020-09-30#:~:text=Nissa%27s%20magic%20merged%20with%20the%20Core%27s%20power.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Episode 5: The Two Guardians\" by A. T. Greenblatt. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 30 Sep 2020."}]},{"text":"Compleated, Nahiri decides to use the Emeria Skyclave to connect the hedron networks during the Phyrexian invasion.","cites":["battles-in-the-field-and-in-the-mind-e0"],"links":["https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/battles-in-the-field-and-in-the-mind#:~:text=the%20Skyclave%20in%20Emeria,the%20entire%20hedron%20networks"],"citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"March of the Machine | Zendikar: Battles in the Field and in the Mind","series":"Magic Story","authors":["A. T. Greenblatt"],"date":"2023-03-27","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/battles-in-the-field-and-in-the-mind","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/battles-in-the-field-and-in-the-mind#:~:text=the%20Skyclave%20in%20Emeria,the%20entire%20hedron%20networks","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"March of the Machine | Zendikar: Battles in the Field and in the Mind\" by A. T. Greenblatt. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 27 Mar 2023."}]}],"status":{"text":"As of the latest story, glowing hedrons float in the rift at the Crucible on Tarkir, where Narset shows them to Elspeth.","cites":["tarkir-dragonstorm-episode-3-what-the-past-devours-e8"],"links":["https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-episode-3-what-the-past-devours#:~:text=Ugin%20taught%20her%20how%20to%20shape%20them."],"