 Story","authors":["Nik Davidson"],"date":"2014-08-06","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dreams-of-the-damned","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dreams-of-the-damned#:~:text=My%20spark%20is%20within%20reach.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Dreams of the Damned\" by Nik Davidson. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 6 Aug 2014."}},{"id":"the-lithomancer-e15","summary":"Over forty years, Nahiri pulls hedrons from the earth and Ugin etches them with runes, creating a trap and a lure for the Eldrazi.","participants":["nahiri","ugin","hedrons"],"location":"zendikar","importance":"major","page":"stories/the-lithomancer","order":47,"story_date":"2014-10-29","storyline":"The Eldrazi Awaken","source":"wizards","paragraph":153,"quote":"It took forty years of near-constant work.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-lithomancer#:~:text=It%20took%20forty%20years%20of%20near%2Dconstant%20work.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Lithomancer","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2014-10-29","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-lithomancer","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-lithomancer#:~:text=It%20took%20forty%20years%20of%20near%2Dconstant%20work.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Lithomancer\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 29 Oct 2014."}},{"id":"the-lithomancer-e18","summary":"Nahiri, Sorin and Ugin focus their power in the Eye of Ugin and shift every hedron into its final position, completing the network.","participants":["nahiri","sorin-markov","ugin","eye-of-ugin","hedrons"],"location":"eye-of-ugin","importance":"major","page":"stories/the-lithomancer","order":47,"story_date":"2014-10-29","storyline":"The Eldrazi Awaken","source":"wizards","paragraph":165,"quote":"Every single hedron on the plane glowed as they shifted into new positions.","link":"https